 begin="00:37.880" end="00:38.840">Delivering </span><span begin="00:38.840" end="00:38.960">her </span><span begin="00:38.960" end="00:39.230">from </span><span begin="00:39.230" end="00:40.070">grace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.750" end="00:43.220"><span begin="00:41.750" end="00:42.020">He </span><span begin="00:42.020" end="00:42.320">knew </span><span begin="00:42.320" end="00:42.440">he </span><span begin="00:42.440" end="00:42.710">should </span><span begin="00:42.710" end="00:43.220">leave</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.810" end="00:47.510"><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:45.080">That </span><span begin="00:45.080" end="00:45.320">this </span><span begin="00:45.320" end="00:45.590">could </span><span begin="00:45.590" end="00:45.920">only </span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.520">turn </span><span begin="00:46.520" end="00:47.510">cold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.140" end="00:50.840"><span begin="00:48.140" end="00:48.530">She </span><span begin="00:48.530" end="00:48.830">was </span><span begin="00:48.830" end="00:48.920">a </span><span begin="00:48.920" end="00:49.400">bad </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:49.820">bad </span><span begin="00:49.820" end="00:50.840">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.860" end="00:53.600"><span begin="00:51.860" end="00:52.220">So </span><span begin="00:52.220" end="00:52.400">he </span><span begin="00:52.400" end="00:52.730">told </span><span begin="00:52.730" end="00:52.820">her </span><span begin="00:52.820" end="00:53.600">so</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.410" end="01:02.870"><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:00.890">Under </span><span begin="01:00.890" end="01:01.010">the </span><span begin="01:01.010" end="01:01.670">shadows </span><span begin="01:01.670" end="01:01.790">of </span><span begin="01:01.790" end="01:02.870">doubt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.890" end="01:06.020"><span begin="01:03.890" end="01:04.130">He </span><span begin="01:04.130" end="01:04.400">had </span><span begin="01:04.400" end="01:04.550">the </span><span begin="01:04.550" end="01:05.060">whisper </span><span begin="01:05.060" end="01:05.210">of </span><span begin="01:05.210" end="01:06.020">lust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.100" end="01:09.830"><span begin="01:07.100" end="01:07.550">He </span><span begin="01:07.550" end="01:07.820">said </span><span begin="01:07.820" end="01:08.000">no </span><span begin="01:08.000" end="01:08.480">touching </span><span begin="01:08.480" end="01:09.830">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.760" end="01:12.950"><span begin="01:10.760" end="01:11.060">She </span><span begin="01:11.060" end="01:11.420">closed </span><span begin="01:11.420" end="01:11.600">her </span><span begin="01:11.600" end="01:11.840">eyes </span><span begin="01:11.840" end="01:11.960">in </span><span begin="01:11.960" end="01:12.170">his </span><span begin="01:12.170" end="01:12.950">trust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.660" end="01:16.520"><span begin="01:14.660" end="01:14.930">She </span><span begin="01:14.930" end="01:15.230">said </span><span begin="01:15.230" end="01:15.500">tuck </span><span begin="01:15.500" end="01:15.710">me </span><span begin="01:15.710" end="01:16.520">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.720" end="01:19.850"><span begin="01:17.720" end="01:18.020">He </span><span begin="01:18.020" end="01:18.260">knew </span><span begin="01:18.260" end="01:18.440">his </span><span begin="01:18.440" end="01:18.920">judgement </span><span begin="01:18.920" end="01:19.070">was </span><span begin="01:19.070" end="01:19.850">sound</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.260" end="01:23.450"><span begin="01:21.260" end="01:21.740">Still </span><span begin="01:21.740" end="01:21.890">he </span><span begin="01:21.890" end="01:22.190">pulled </span><span begin="01:22.190" end="01:22.430">back </span><span begin="01:22.430" end="01:22.520">the </span><span begin="01:22.520" end="01:23.450">sheets</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.680" end="01:28.610"><span begin="01:24.680" end="01:24.950">And </span><span begin="01:24.950" end="01:25.220">said </span><span begin="01:25.220" end="01:25.370">you </span><span begin="01:25.370" end="01:25.820">better </span><span begin="01:25.820" end="01:26.210">lie </span><span begin="01:26.210" end="01:26.690">down </span><span begin="01:26.690" end="01:26.990">cause </span><span begin="01:26.990" end="01:27.170">the </span><span begin="01:27.170" end="01:27.680">angels </span><span begin="01:27.680" end="01:27.800">are </span><span begin="01:27.800" end="01:28.610">watching</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.610" end="01:32.630"><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:28.850">She </span><span begin="01:28.850" end="01:29.330">closed </span><span begin="01:29.330" end="01:29.750">her </span><span begin="01:29.750" end="01:30.260">eyes </span><span begin="01:30.260" end="01:30.590">and </span><span begin="01:30.590" end="01:30.830">said </span><span begin="01:30.830" end="01:31.040">quit </span><span begin="01:31.040" end="01:31.220">the </span><span begin="01:31.220" end="01:32.630">talking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.660" end="01:35.630"><span begin="01:32.660" end="01:32.990">You </span><span begin="01:32.990" end="01:33.200">can </span><span begin="01:33.200" end="01:33.410">hurt </span><span begin="01:33.410" end="01:33.620">me </span><span begin="01:33.620" end="01:33.890">do </span><span begin="01:33.890" end="01:34.550">whatever </span><span begin="01:34.550" end="01:34.730">you </span><span begin="01:34.730" end="01:35.630">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.920" end="01:51.680"><span begin="01:48.920" end="01:49.280">Her </span><span begin="01:49.280" end="01:49.670">every </span><span begin="01:49.670" end="01:49.970">word </span><span begin="01:49.970" end="01:50.240">was </span><span begin="01:50.240" end="01:50.420">in </span><span begin="01:50.420" end="01:51.680">italics</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.520" end="01:54.620"><span begin="01:52.520" end="01:52.820">As </span><span begin="01:52.820" end="01:52.940">it </span><span begin="01:52.940" end="01:53.120">would </span><span begin="01:53.120" end="01:53.390">fall </span><span begin="01:53.390" end="01:53.660">from </span><span begin="01:53.660" end="01:53.810">her </span><span begin="01:53.810" end="01:54.620">lips</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.910" end="01:58.700"><span begin="01:55.910" end="01:56.150">The </span><span begin="01:56.150" end="01:56.600">walls </span><span begin="01:56.600" end="01:56.930">made </span><span begin="01:56.930" end="01:57.050">of </span><span begin="01:57.050" end="01:57.470">broken </span><span begin="01:57.470" end="01:58.700">promises</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.360" end="02:01.610"><span begin="01:59.360" end="01:59.630">He </span><span begin="01:59.630" end="01:59.900">hoped </span><span begin="01:59.900" end="02:00.110">this </span><span begin="02:00.110" end="02:00.500">wouldn't </span><span begin="02:00.500" end="02:00.740">be </span><span begin="02:00.740" end="02:01.610">his</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.990" end="02:05.330"><span begin="02:02.990" end="02:03.320">She </span><span begin="02:03.320" end="02:03.530">said </span><span begin="02:03.530" end="02:03.800">tell </span><span begin="02:03.800" end="02:03.950">me </span><span begin="02:03.950" end="02:04.220">what </span><span begin="02:04.220" end="02:04.400">to </span><span begin="02:04.400" end="02:05.330">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.290" end="02:08.510"><span begin="02:06.290" end="02:06.590">He </span><span begin="02:06.590" end="02:06.800">knew </span><span begin="02:06.800" end="02:07.070">right </span><span begin="02:07.070" end="02:07.310">then </span><span begin="02:07.310" end="02:07.460">he </span><span begin="02:07.460" end="02:07.730">was </span><span begin="02:07.730" end="02:08.510">done</span></p><p t